Professional Services Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Singletrack Trails, Inc. for
North Cheyenne Community Park Singletrack Trail Design and Construction (Recreational Trails
Program grant funds and donations) -- referred to Finance Committee.  Mr. Brown advised in order to
meet the proposed construction schedule time frame, the item was reviewed under other items for the
agenda at the Finance Committee meeting and provisions of Title 2 of City Code had been met.  Mr.
Brown moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $42,790.00, seconded by Mr. Valdez.  Jeff
Wiggins, Parks and Recreation Dept., advised the agreement is follow-up for grant funding for the
project through the Recreational Trails program, and also noted private donations that have been offered
toward the project by Paul Frauendienst, Dan Gregg and Larry Sutherland.  He stated in order to abide
with the construction trail schedule, the item was brought up under other items for the agenda at Finance
Committee.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present. (#5973)
