advised the item was reviewed under other items for the agenda at the Finance Committee meeting and
provisions of Title 2 of City Code had been met.  Mr. Brown moved to approve, seconded by Mr.
Valdez.  Mr. Brown moved to amend by substitute, seconded by Mr. Valdez.  Todd Feezer, Assistant
Parks and Recreation Director, advised the substitute amends the daily use fee charged for the facility
